Changed: IBTK::HierarchyIntegrator overrides canKeepUnchangedLevels() and initializeKeptLevelData() of SAMRAI::mesh::StandardTagAndInitStrategy, and IBTK::StandardTagAndInitStrategySet forwards them. IBAMR::PhaseChangeHierarchyIntegrator and IBAMR::AllenCahnHierarchyIntegrator no longer deallocate their solvers when a regrid begins. The initializeOperatorState() functions of the convective operators, and the initializeSTSIntegrator() functions of IBAMR::INSVCStaggeredConservativeMassMomentumRKIntegrator and IBAMR::AdvDiffConservativeMassScalarTransportRKIntegrator, no longer deallocate their ghost-fill operators, algorithms, and schedules when the object is already initialized. The ghost-fill operator members of these classes and of the hierarchy integrators no longer own the operator. This change requires the IBSAMRAI2 release that provides keep_unchanged_levels.
<br>
(Boyce Griffith, 2026/11/26)
